  "description": "Backend-for-Frontend (BFF) authentication broker for ASP.NET Core. Implements secure SSO with Azure AD, Auth0, Okta and Google. Keeps tokens out of the browser with HttpOnly encrypted cookies, built-in CSRF protection, rate limiting, audit logging, and JIT user provisioning. Supports multi-tenant Azure AD.",
